{"1757030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Heroes for Hire: Crowns of the Realm", "steam_appid": 1757030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757030/extras/7a8d7209298bc1f2c68c1aef25bf394b.avif?t=1785697127\" width=780 height=287 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Five ancient crowns, one realm, one true ruler. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Recruit your fantasy heroes and unite the realm!</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a huge world map filled with towns, strongholds, ruins, lairs, forests, caves and so on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Campaign Quests along with various Quest Types to fulfill. Quests include raid, fetch, timed, elimination, garrison  and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Different Character Classes (Fighter, Archer, Mage, Knight, Ranger, Cleric) with 5 Ranks per class</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical turn-based combat. Take command yourself or let the auto battle decide</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 unique Heroes to manage</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Trade, loot and gather over 50 unique items </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Battle Simulator for quick, random skirmishes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757030/extras/67fe3b73d4b4f85c3d7e3a60fbcf45f3.avif?t=1785697127\" width=780 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a huge fantasy world as you recruit and manage heroes. Send them on quests. Promote them as they gain experience. Watch them gain new skills and improve their equipment. Strategically decide which quests to take on and which heroes to send where.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757030/extras/98ce6d424c2079f9d135d1386a8756af.avif?t=1785697127\" width=780 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Recruit 60 unique heroes from 6 different classes. No two heroes are alike. Each have their own identity and appearance. Promote them as they complete quests. Watch them gain titles and  unlock new skills as they gain in rank. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757030/extras/f2afd126e3918976ffca3edfa14853c8.avif?t=1785697127\" width=780 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Engage in turn-based tactical combat against a wide array of enemies including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Goblin fighters, archers, heavies and shamans</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Undead soldiers, archers, knights and shamans</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cave spiders</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Ice beasts</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Brigands and bandits</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Golems</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Forest witches and guardians</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragons</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757030/extras/eaa1c12545c253faae4387a2a15f3624.avif?t=1785697127\" width=780 height=438 /></span>React to random events as your heroes travel the land. Each decision could change the outcome of the game. Which choice will you make? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757030/extras/057466c6478d737919c7a91063500618.avif?t=1785697127\" width=780 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the five ancient crowns of the realm and proclaim yourself the one true ruler!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757030/extras/7a8d7209298bc1f2c68c1aef25bf394b.avif?t=1785697127\" width=780 height=287 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Five ancient crowns, one realm, one true ruler. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Recruit your fantasy heroes and unite the realm!</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a huge world map filled with towns, strongholds, ruins, lairs, forests, caves and so on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Campaign Quests along with various Quest Types to fulfill. Quests include raid, fetch, timed, elimination, garrison  and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Different Character Classes (Fighter, Archer, Mage, Knight, Ranger, Cleric) with 5 Ranks per class</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical turn-based combat. Take command yourself or let the auto battle decide</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 unique Heroes to manage</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Trade, loot and gather over 50 unique items </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Battle Simulator for quick, random skirmishes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757030/extras/67fe3b73d4b4f85c3d7e3a60fbcf45f3.avif?t=1785697127\" width=780 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a huge fantasy world as you recruit and manage heroes. Send them on quests. Promote them as they gain experience. Watch them gain new skills and improve their equipment. Strategically decide which quests to take on and which heroes to send where.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757030/extras/98ce6d424c2079f9d135d1386a8756af.avif?t=1785697127\" width=780 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Recruit 60 unique heroes from 6 different classes. No two heroes are alike. Each have their own identity and appearance. Promote them as they complete quests. Watch them gain titles and  unlock new skills as they gain in rank. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757030/extras/f2afd126e3918976ffca3edfa14853c8.avif?t=1785697127\" width=780 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Engage in turn-based tactical combat against a wide array of enemies including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Goblin fighters, archers, heavies and shamans</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Undead soldiers, archers, knights and shamans</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cave spiders</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Ice beasts</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Brigands and bandits</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Golems</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Forest witches and guardians</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragons</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757030/extras/eaa1c12545c253faae4387a2a15f3624.avif?t=1785697127\" width=780 height=438 /></span>React to random events as your heroes travel the land. Each decision could change the outcome of the game. Which choice will you make? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757030/extras/057466c6478d737919c7a91063500618.avif?t=1785697127\" width=780 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the five ancient crowns of the realm and proclaim yourself the one true ruler!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Heroes for Hire: Crowns of the Realm is a fantasy real-time strategy game. Explore a huge fantasy world and manage heroes. Decide which quests to fulfill and search for the ancient crowns. Engage in tactical turn-based battles against a wide array of enemies. Five crowns, one realm, one true ruler.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757030/bfc46eaa358b0efadf9d983bc1d57375427e298b/header.jpg?t=1785697127", "capsule_image"